German Company Financials: Data Product Overview and Use Cases
The API products provided by Implisense help you to enrich your Customer Relationship Management (CRM) system, your Marketing Automation (MAS) system, or other B2B systems you may have in use. This specific API provides financial information about German companies where available. As input it takes the Implisense ID, which you can obtain via the German Company Lookup product. The provided information includes balance sheet total, revenue, profit and loss as well as number of employees.
IMPORTANT: Our German Company Lookup product also provides you with an endpoint to verify the availability of financial information (GET /companies/{id}/financials/exists). It is recommended you use this endpoint as its cost is significantly lower than for this API here (subscription is free, pricing is based on usage only).
In addition, our German Company Data product provides you with company data and management information for these companies.
Data Format
The result for a GET /companies/DEVFCLQFW054/financials for Implisense produces this result:
{
    "id": "DEVFCLQFW054",
    "balanceSheetTotal": [
        {
            "year": 2017,
            "currency": "EUR",
            "value": 12345678.90
        },
        {
            "year": 2018,
            "currency": "EUR",
            "value": 12345678.90
        },
        {
            "year": 2019,
            "currency": "EUR",
            "value": 12345678.90
        },
        {
            "year": 2020,
            "currency": "EUR",
            "value": 12345678.90
        }
    ],
    "numberOfEmployees": [
        {
            "year": 2018,
            "value": 123
        },
        {
            "year": 2019,
            "value": 123
        }
    ]
}
Additional Information
Here you find the full documentation to all the endpoints provided by this API:
GET /companies/{id}/financials (Documentation 
)
POST /companies/financials (Documentation 
)
Pricing Information
Subscription to this API is free of charge. Pricing is based on usage of the API. A unit fee of $0.001 applies for each successful call to the API.
Need Help?
If you have questions about our products, please contact us at support@implisense.com.
About Implisense
Implisense is the leading provider of German B2B company data. With over 2.5 million active companies from the German Handelsregister listed in its index Implisense provides not only contact information, but a detailed analysis integrating many data sources, such as websites, news, press releases, financial data, and job announcements. Implisense supports numerous use cases for sales and marketing departments, such as lead generation, lead scoring, and account intelligence. For more information please visit us at implisense.com 
.

German Company Data: Data Product Overview and Use Cases
The API products provided by Implisense help you to enrich your Customer Relationship Management (CRM) system, your Marketing Automation (MAS) system, or other B2B systems you may have in use. This specific API provides company data and management information about German companies. As input it takes the Implisense ID, which you can obtain via the German Company Lookup product. The provided information includes contact data (address, email, website, social media), legal information (Handelsregister ID, legal form, foundation), industry, size, and more.
In addition, our German Company Financials product provides you with financial key figures for these companies.
Data Format
